<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Whole Foods raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Whole Foods raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it raised its rating on Whole Foods Market Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 22.</p>
</text>
